<div class="text-page">
<h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
<p class="intro">Transparency on how Choosimple is funded and how that affects what we recommend.</p>
<div class="text-brand-proofline"><strong>Choosimple promise:</strong> affiliate links may support the site, but the decision still comes first. Products are selected for fit, reliability, and long-term ownership value.</div>
<div class="about-section">
<h2>Amazon Associates Program</h2>
<p>Choosimple is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com and affiliated Amazon sites.</p>
<p>As an Amazon Associate, we earn from qualifying purchases. This means that when you click a "Check price" link on this site and subsequently make a purchase on Amazon, we may receive a small commission at no additional cost to you.</p>
</div>
<div class="about-section">
<h2>How this affects our recommendations</h2>
<p>It doesn't. Our product recommendations are determined independently through our research process by analyzing reliability data, expert testing, long-term owner feedback, and real-world performance patterns. Products are selected based on merit.</p>
<p>The same product would be recommended whether or not an affiliate program existed. Commission rates play no role in which product is selected as the Choosimple pick in any category.</p>
</div>
<div class="about-section">
<h2>Pricing and availability</h2>
<p>Product prices and availability are accurate as of the date each page was last updated. Prices can change frequently on Amazon and other retailers. Always verify the current price before purchasing.</p>
<p>Choosimple has no control over product pricing, availability, or third-party seller practices on Amazon or any other retailer.</p>
<p>Some product links may be routed through Geniuslink to help send readers to the appropriate Amazon storefront based on location. This does not affect which products are recommended.</p></div>
<div class="about-section">
<h2>Other affiliate relationships</h2>
<p>From time to time, Choosimple may participate in other affiliate programs beyond Amazon Associates. Any such relationships will be disclosed on the relevant pages. In all cases, the principle is the same: compensation does not influence which products are recommended.</p>
</div>
<div class="about-section">
<h2>FTC compliance</h2>
<p>This disclosure is provided in accordance with the Federal Trade Commission's guidelines on endorsements and testimonials (16 CFR Part 255) and the FTC's guidance on affiliate marketing. If you have any questions about this disclosure or our practices, please contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@choosimple.com">hello@choosimple.com</a>.</p>
</div>
</div>
